    NormalText: 
  PaperText:
    GlocText: "*To the One Who Has Returned,  Blood remembers. So does the house.
      You walk these halls, yet you do not know their shape. The Drakemore name was
      built on secrets \u2014 we buried them deep. You must find the three marks
      and return them to the chapel. But beware: the Watcher is awake. Do not linger
      in its gaze.  \u2014 A."
    NormalText: 'This is an example text for a paper to demonstrate the examination
      system. You can display the text on the paper using a texture or rewrite the
      text as paper examination text.


      - From Patrick'
