  PaperText:
    GlocText: "*We tried to bind it. We failed. The blood wasn\u2019t enough. The
      sigils cracked. One mark remains hidden behind the face of faith. Another lost
      in the child\u2019s last dream. The third sleeps beneath us, still warm. Complete
      the circle. Or it will feed again."
    NormalText: 'This is an example text for a paper to demonstrate the examination
      system. You can display the text on the paper using a texture or rewrite the
      text as paper examination text.


      - From Patrick'
