  PaperText:
    GlocText: "*To the Heir Unknowing, The bloodline binds tighter than chains. The
      ritual was never broken \u2014 only paused. You must finish what was started,
      or the Veiled One will feed again. The sigil is hidden behind false piety.
      Seek the light through stained glass. \u2014 E.D."
    NormalText: 'This is an example text for a paper to demonstrate the examination
      system. You can display the text on the paper using a texture or rewrite the
      text as paper examination text.


      - From Patrick'
